:: awakening__front_door [awakening]
<!-- harness:meta
location: cartography_shop
-->

You open the door to find no one there. The street is empty, pre-dawn grey. But nailed to your door frame is a brass plaque stamped with the Guild's seal: a compass rose inside a clenched fist. The edges are still hot to the touch.

This is a summons. The Guild does not send letters. They brand your door, and you have three days to present yourself or they send Collectors.

You know what this means. Someone has reported you. Perhaps the ink-bleed was visible through the window. Perhaps a neighbor heard the sound the parchment made when it rewrote itself, a sound like tearing silk played backward.

<<set $guild_trust to $guild_trust - 2>>

You need to act before the three days run out.

[[Go to the Guild and face them|the_guild__guild_hall]]
[[Flee the city for the frontier|the_frontier__departure]]
